DATA TERMS

The individual-level survey data (data/raw_responses.xlsx) are NOT included in
this repository and are NOT covered by the MIT licence that applies to the code.

Human-participants data were collected under the study's ethics approval. Because
the survey records childhood country, refugee-camp residence, arrest and
displacement history, and political-expression items for identifiable minority
populations, the data are available from the corresponding author on reasonable
request, subject to that approval.

The aggregate results in output/tables/ and output/figures/ contain no
individual-level records and are released with the code.
